  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "Rungs 02–06 use the rung-01 bodies `ccBGSSSE003EncZombie01Body{A,B,C}` as their template for `Traits` only, not `Stats`, so every rung owns its level, and changing rung 01 (or `EncDraugr01Template`) changes none of them.",
      "The four summon copies `ccBGSSSE003EncZombie01BodyA_Summon` 000874 (level 3), `…02BodyB_Summon` 000873 (6), `…03BodyC_Summon` 000875 (13) and `…04BodyA_Summon` 000876 (21) use the rung-01 bodies the same way and keep their own level, so a change to rung 02, 03 or 04 does not reach them (on Conjured → *Undead Summons*).",
      "The wrapper `ccBGSSSE003_LvlEncZombie` 000810 takes `Stats`, `Traits` and `BaseData` from the zombie list."
    ]
  },
